Comment: 9,0:23:28.97,0:23:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtitles: Thomas Chaumont

Dialogue: 9,0:00:00.48,0:00:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I got one disc back.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:02.15,0:00:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:03.11,0:00:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can bring him back to life.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:05.07,0:00:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know\Nis that the disc has this power.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:08.12,0:00:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll call this operation\Nthe "Savage Garden Plan".{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him with you.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be able to help you.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.95,0:00:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Weather Report.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jack Flash!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:21.67,0:00:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:29.93,0:00:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But him, where is he?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:00:33.10,0:00:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to get the disc back!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:09.57,0:02:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Emergency alert activated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:11.53,0:02:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Corridor 7B.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:13.45,0:02:16.07,TiretsDefault,,625,0,0,,{\an7}– Yes, corridor 7B.\N{\i1}– Emergency alert activated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:16.16,0:02:19.33,TiretsDefault,,485,0,0,,– We're waiting for a report.\N– What's causing this commotion?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:19.54,0:02:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no information.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:21.04,0:02:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But corridor 7B only leads\Nto the workshop.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:25.38,0:02:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be a riot.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:28.84,0:02:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:30.22,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, all right.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:32.55,0:02:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have complete trust\Nin the inmates.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:36.89,0:02:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This commotion has made me curious,\Nthat's all.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:41.64,0:02:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You surely know
Dialogue: 9,0:02:43.94,0:02:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,that no one has managed\Nto escape here in 20 years.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:47.94,0:02:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the courtyard opens onto corridor 7B.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:50.61,0:02:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would dare escape from there.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:56.41,0:02:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll handle it, Father.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you to it, then.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:06.46,0:03:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,One last question.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the clock accurate?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:13.17,0:03:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:14.68,0:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 11:58.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:17.43,0:03:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost lunchtime.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:23.39,0:03:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At 11:51,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:25.65,0:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a call to the Speedwagon Foundation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the same request as usual.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:32.53,0:03:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I want access to the call log\Nand the conversation recordings.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:37.74,0:03:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Women's prison, booth number 16.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:40.95,0:03:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A conversation of about seven minutes.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:44.33,0:03:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you touched me,
Dialogue: 9,0:03:48.42,0:03:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't weigh anything either now.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:56.09,0:03:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see our enemy anywhere.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get the disc back.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be in this laundry room.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.98,0:04:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The courtyard is behind this door.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:11.61,0:04:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This door you're trying to reach
Dialogue: 9,0:04:14.57,0:04:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,must be locked.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:17.03,0:04:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to use force,\Nmaybe even an explosion.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:21.99,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I have to do.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:25.95,0:04:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this isn't the time,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's something private.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:31.13,0:04:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's urgent,\Nand I have to go now.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:34.71,0:04:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I feel the urge now.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:39.97,0:04:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:41.97,0:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it's something we all have to do.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:48.44,0:04:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a P-word\Nrelated to the pelvic area.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:51.65,0:04:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The natural need that brings relief
Dialogue: 9,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,when it isn't number two.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to take a piss.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:58.99,0:05:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come up to me just to say that.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:01.41,0:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious. I have to go.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pick a corner of the room.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.79,0:05:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, why am I trying to talk\Nabout this with a guy?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I already relieved myself.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:14.59,0:05:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,See? It's floating over there.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:18.30,0:05:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When the body enters zero gravity,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,blood rushes to the head in massive amounts.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:23.76,0:05:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood usually present\Nin the lower limbs
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.35,0:05:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,colonizes the space between the skin\Nand the bones of the skull,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,causing swelling\Nknown as "moon face."
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.57,0:05:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:37.78,0:05:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the kidneys detect\Nthe danger this poses to the body
Dialogue: 9,0:05:40.80,0:05:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,from this change in circulation.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:42.62,0:05:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They work to reduce\Nthe volume of blood in the body,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:45.78,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,which triggers an acute diuretic effect
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.74,0:05:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that reduces blood volume
Dialogue: 9,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,by expelling salt.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:52.75,0:05:54.75,TiretsDefault,,629,0,0,,– But...\N– No need to be ashamed.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll absorb your urine\Nwith my clouds.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.97,0:05:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:01.09,0:06:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are these droplets?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cloud has a leak!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:18.32,0:06:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:21.49,0:06:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's being sucked through\Nthe gap between the doors!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.12,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too. I'm bleeding.\NMy wound from earlier.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:27.62,0:06:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!\NMy nose won't stop bleeding!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:30.12,0:06:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having trouble breathing...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:38.00,0:06:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:48.30,0:06:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything I touch\Nenters zero gravity.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:53.02,0:06:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I touched the walls around the door.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.98,0:07:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means the entire room\Nis free of gravity!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:02.49,0:07:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The air!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The air is leaving the room, weightless.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.49,0:07:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The gravitational force\Naround the room is sucking the air out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:07:10.58,0:07:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to plug this hole.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:12.96,0:07:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'll die of asphyxiation!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:16.33,0:07:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:17.71,0:07:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Asphyxiation isn't\Nour most pressing concern.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:19.80,0:07:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our blood will boil first,\Nand that's what will kill us.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.76,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In a vacuum, blood boils like water.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In a zero-gravity vacuum,
Dialogue: 9,0:07:31.22,0:07:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,it only takes 20 seconds for blood\Nto evaporate out of the human body.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:48.45,0:07:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I reload?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:53.74,0:07:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get shot.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hide somewhere!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:57.92,0:07:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:59.34,0:08:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose is bleeding, I'm draining dry!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop the air from leaving the room!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:33.99,0:08:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Take short breaths.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:36.79,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I gathered what little air\Nwas left in the room
Dialogue: 9,0:08:40.08,0:08:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to cover our bodies in clouds.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.05,0:08:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloud spacesuits.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:48.17,0:08:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The room is an almost perfect vacuum.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:50.39,0:08:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All the remaining air is here.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:53.97,0:08:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your nosebleed has stopped.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:56.89,0:09:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will we be able to breathe?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:00.69,0:09:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not answer that.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:02.90,0:09:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say about two minutes.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:05.36,0:09:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're as good as dead in these clouds.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't defeat the enemy\Nin under two minutes,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll vanish into the vacuum,\Nright?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:14.53,0:09:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:20.21,0:09:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find him.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:21.63,0:09:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever we do,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.88,0:09:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,if he attacks, he'll finish us off.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.63,0:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my nose has stopped bleeding,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.51,0:09:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Jolyne.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:32.51,0:09:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I said two minutes,\Nbut it might be one.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:35.06,0:09:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find him right now!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're breathing in more and more CO2!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:39.39,0:09:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The laundry baskets.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:40.98,0:09:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not floating.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:43.56,0:09:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Those baskets over there.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:46.11,0:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I touched the walls of this room,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:49.74,0:09:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,which made the gravity disappear inside
Dialogue: 9,0:09:52.45,0:09:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and made the objects float.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are these baskets and jerry cans\Nstuck to the wall
Dialogue: 9,0:09:59.08,0:10:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of floating?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, this enemy.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:04.33,0:10:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he\Nbreathing in a vacuum?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:08.30,0:10:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,His blood should be boiling, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 9,0:10:17.39,0:10:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the range of his power.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:20.52,0:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero gravity stops\Nafter a certain distance.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This room isn't\Nentirely affected.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:25.90,0:10:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The range of his power, you say?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:27.86,0:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,From here to the laundry baskets,
Dialogue: 9,0:10:30.11,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it's about 20 meters.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero gravity stops over there.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:34.03,0:10:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can get there,\Nwe'll be able to breathe normally.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:37.66,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Weather Report.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's outside the vacuum zone.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't control the air now,
Dialogue: 9,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll never catch up with our enemy.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're probably right.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:49.59,0:10:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The other side of this cage.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Weather Report.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:59.60,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the pressure dropping\Ninside my spacesuit.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:02.56,0:11:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Go before the cloud spacesuit\Nscatters into the vacuum!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:24.16,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't leave\Nthe range of my power!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.09,0:11:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to attack him?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.30,0:11:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect Weather Report!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:42.77,0:11:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He caught up with me.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm charging!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:20.26,0:12:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a few meters left\Nbefore he reaches the oxygen.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:23.64,0:12:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Weather Report controls the air,
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.40,0:12:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be finished!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:28.15,0:12:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want air so badly,\Ngo ahead, no problem.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:31.65,0:12:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to go\Nall the way to the laundry baskets.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already finished
Dialogue: 9,0:12:36.74,0:12:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,my attack.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:40.91,0:12:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to ricochet\Nthe bullets to hit him.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:45.95,0:12:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was aiming for the jerry can!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:51.42,0:12:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a little air left inside.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:54.30,0:12:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,High-pressure air.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.14,0:12:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is going to explode!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's entering zero gravity again.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done for.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:17.82,0:13:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to stop his momentum.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:23.99,0:13:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:26.08,0:13:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the end.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:27.04,0:13:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The spacesuit is giving out!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:38.71,0:13:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne! Are you insane?!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:41.22,0:13:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:42.47,0:13:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to shoot you down!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:43.89,0:13:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That burst alone\Nwill be enough to scatter your spacesuit!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:47.64,0:13:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This woman makes her decisions\Nat lightning speed.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.73,0:13:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She's charging at that bastard\Nto stop his movement
Dialogue: 9,0:13:54.56,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and push him back out\Nof my power's reach again!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.11,0:14:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.24,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:06.74,0:14:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew about it.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:08.54,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Stand is very powerful.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:11.37,0:14:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My spinning bullets\Naren't fast enough against it.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:17.13,0:14:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I came prepared.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:19.55,0:14:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I searched for them.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:21.22,0:14:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I captured them for this very moment.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There are more than I expected.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.85,0:14:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rats! They're alive!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.64,0:14:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are they...{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:14:33.10,0:14:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this vermin away from me!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.90,0:14:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:42.74,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you\Nto stand up to me like this.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:49.08,0:14:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Jolyne Kujo!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:54.37,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:03.80,0:15:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jack Flash.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Too powerful.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:07.35,0:15:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My power is invincible.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:09.64,0:15:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What luck to have landed\Nin this prison.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:12.06,0:15:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I acquired this power within these walls.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:14.52,0:15:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing\NI can't accomplish in this world.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bright future.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hand this disc over to Whitesnake.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I could do it myself.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:26.66,0:15:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wanted to!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:46.76,0:15:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd do that.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.39,0:15:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting
Dialogue: 9,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,for you to reload.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:53.73,0:15:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting, with my strings ready,
Dialogue: 9,0:15:55.98,0:15:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,for you to reload your gun.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:58.23,0:16:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And you shot at me.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These strings!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:02.49,0:16:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you do that?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.49,0:16:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Free!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.49,0:16:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:21.00,0:16:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one in a complete vacuum.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:24.55,0:16:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 9,0:16:25.80,0:16:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,without a spacesuit,\Nyour blood vessels are going to burst
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.10,0:16:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,because your blood will boil in no time!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.64,0:16:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've won!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live,
Dialogue: 9,0:16:36.27,0:16:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,release this room from your power!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:46.19,0:16:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was sentenced{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:49.15,0:16:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for how many stab wounds, again?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:52.78,0:16:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I killed that teacher,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:55.79,0:16:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the prosecutor said\NI stabbed her 69 times.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This urge.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:01.59,0:17:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's surging up in me again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:05.09,0:17:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let you underestimate me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:07.26,0:17:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bitch!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:17:10.38,0:17:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The reaction between hydrogen peroxide\Nand manganese dioxide
Dialogue: 9,0:17:13.64,0:17:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,produces oxygen.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:16.52,0:17:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of oxygen in this flask!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:21.69,0:17:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough to satisfy my slaughter urge\Nlike last time!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.91,0:17:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:27.86,0:17:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,With this glass, I'm going to turn
Dialogue: 9,0:17:30.24,0:17:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,your piss-filled body\Ninto a tombstone!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:43.83,0:17:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolyne Kujo,\Nyour vessels will burst first
Dialogue: 9,0:17:47.51,0:17:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,since you're wounded all over!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:49.97,0:17:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm incarcerated for murder, you know.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:52.43,0:17:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, and when I leave\Nthis room, I'll be invincible!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be enough
Dialogue: 9,0:18:08.53,0:18:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to get the disc back
Dialogue: 9,0:18:12.53,0:18:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,from that scumbag's hands.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:17.49,0:18:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:19.58,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:21.71,0:18:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it, my body's reached its limit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:25.54,0:18:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I deactivate my power,\Nthere'll be a huge rush of air.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:29.13,0:18:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I can escape\Nwith the air current.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:18:32.34,0:18:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero gravity, deactivated!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:34.85,0:18:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jack Flash!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:48.98,0:18:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have deactivated it\Nas soon as you had the chance.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.03,0:18:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The pressure gradient\Nwould have let you escape.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:55.66,0:18:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you had done that\Nwhile Stone Free was far away...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:00.00,0:19:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The air current is pushing you back to me!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:29.06,0:19:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When is the Speedwagon Foundation arriving?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:32.99,0:19:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In three minutes? Or two?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a corridor behind this door.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:39.53,0:19:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,On the right,\Nwindows overlook the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.75,0:19:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to see\Nthe gate leading to the revolving door.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The revolving door leads to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:50.63,0:19:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's accessible during the day,\Nand it's not locked.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:55.47,0:19:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The next challenge is opening this door.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have a guard open it.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.22,0:20:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We have his work permit.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll force a guard to open it.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:08.52,0:20:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:10.19,0:20:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the door is open,\Nyou knock out the guards
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and rush to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:18.03,0:20:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be convicted\Nfor attempted escape
Dialogue: 9,0:20:21.16,0:20:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but also thrown in solitary\Nfor six months,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:24.12,0:20:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,where you won't even\Nbe able to get enough exercise.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:28.17,0:20:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:30.13,0:20:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the courtyard
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.09,0:20:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to hand this disc to someone\Nfrom the Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:35.59,0:20:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my only mission in life\Nright now.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:47.93,0:20:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The guards are coming.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:49.64,0:20:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Report,\Ngo hide somewhere.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:52.98,0:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll manage on my own.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:55.07,0:20:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're seriously wounded,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:56.99,0:20:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and if the guards see your wounds,
Dialogue: 9,0:20:59.49,0:21:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,they might close the gate.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:01.24,0:21:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I understand.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:08.25,0:21:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:10.17,0:21:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why are you banging like that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:16.09,0:21:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, it's you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:17.84,0:21:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh, it's you"?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:20.38,0:21:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on, Rangler?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:22.60,0:21:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's all this noise?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:24.35,0:21:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, I'm opening.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:32.65,0:21:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're going back\Nto the men's prison,
Dialogue: 9,0:21:35.11,0:21:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lang Rangler,
Dialogue: 9,0:21:36.53,0:21:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't we take a little break\Nat the chapel?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things I need to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:43.57,0:21:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's not a guard!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:53.83,0:21:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who's that guy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:55.88,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Neither a guard nor an inmate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:21:59.88,0:22:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's that uniform?{\i0}
